  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Business forum Windhoek</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of former Prime Minister Rutte&apos;s visit to Namibia and South Africa on 19 and 20 June 2023, the Netherlands embassy in Pretoria, South Africa organised two business forums in Windhoek (Namibia) and Pretoria (South Africa).On his visit, former Prime Minister Rutte was accompanied by five Dutch key players in the Green Hydrogen (GH2) field:&#x2022;	Port of Rotterdam,&#x2022;	Invest International,&#x2022;	Gasunie,&#x2022;	TNO and&#x2022;	VNO-NCW.During the business forums, these businesses and other Dutch, Namibian and South African GH2 players discussed the needs and the opportunities in the respective countries for developing the GH2 economy. Agreements, that will further contribute to the transition, were signed.</narrative>
  </description>
